r CI, etc. Provide code.\n\nLet's propose: create a git repo in /Users/riwana/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nutrameiant_site, copy updated HTML, add .gitignore, and commit. Then if remote repo URL is known, push.\n\nBut we still lack remote URL.\n\nThus we must ask for remote repo location.\n\nWe can propose a script that, if run on the server, will replace the header and restart. Provide instructions.\n\nGiven policy: must not ask user? The request says \"doesn't involve me\". But we need something.\n\nWe can create a self-contained script that uses SSH to connect to the server and modify files if we have credentials. Could we retrieve credentials from environment? Not.\n\nThus must inform limitation.\n\nWill output a strategic high-quality scenario: create a CI/CD pipeline that automatically updates header when commit changes detected. Provide code for GitHub Actions etc.\n\nLet's do that.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
